    "question": "If x + (1/x) = 4, find the numerical value of x^3 + (1/x^3).",
    "options": [
      "48",
      "52",
      "56",
      "64"
    ],
    "answer": "52",
    "explanation": "Identity: (x + 1/x)^3 = x^3 + 1/x^3 + 3(x + 1/x). Substituting x + 1/x = 4: 4^3 = x^3 + 1/x^3 + 3(4) => 64 = x^3 + 1/x^3 + 12 => x^3 + 1/x^3 = 64 - 12 = 52.",
